mount to a request for services, such as setting your privacy preferences, logging in or remembering information on order forms. You can set your browser to block or alert you about these cookies, but some parts of the website will not work as a result. These cookies do not store any personally identifiable information.\\",\\"title\\":\\"Strictly necessary cookies\\"},\\"performance\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our website. They help us to know which pages are the most and least popular and see how visitors move around the website. These cookies do not collect data that could identify you and are only used to help us improve our website and how it works. They also help us understand our users\' interests and measure our effectiveness.\\",\\"title\\":\\"Performance cookies\\"},\\"popup\\":{\\"description\\":\\"KICK and our partners use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized content, measure how the website is used, and for advertising, marketing and social media purposes. By clicking \\\\\\"Accept all\\\\\\", you consent to our use of cookies.\\",\\"title\\":\\"You are in control of cookies used\\"},\\"targeting\\":{\\"description\\":\\"These cookies are linked to services provided by us and/or third parties and may be set through our website by us and/or our advertising partners. They may be used by those companies to build a profile of your interests and show you relevant advertisements on our website and other websites. They may also be used for other advertising purposes including serving and rendering advertisements, frequency capping, tracking clicks, personalizing advertisements and any other research relating to serving advertisements. They do not store directly personal information, but are based on uniquely identifying your browser and internet device. These cookies are not necessary for the function of the website and you can cho